{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "71cab314eec9012d37806d0d8fa6fc27e5e5b3e114a7fe4f6ad20dc0741237a8", "ja": "目指せ☆★女子のカリスマ", "zh": "目标是☆★女生的潮流领袖", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f34781722294abfa520d11646e0db61f7f8a5d82fb988ac68230325b1b896ca5", "ja": "有名ファッション誌の姉妹誌からオファーが\nきた。雑誌掲載、イベント出演に加え、人気\n投票1位なら1年間の活動が約束される。先方\nから指名されたのは美奈子と奈緒。仲間兼ラ\nイバルとして気合いを見せるふたり。", "zh": "知名时尚杂志的姊妹刊发来了邀约。除杂志刊载、活动出演外，若在人气投票中获得第1名，还将获得1年的活动保障。对方点名的是美奈子和奈绪。两人既是伙伴又是对手，都摩拳擦掌、斗志昂扬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "187b092980229d313a0416e5fdb916992f2c99493ed053cf29afcc529c125842", "ja": "（今の時間なら、美奈子と奈緒は劇場にいるはず。\nこの話を聞いたら、きっとふたりとも喜ぶぞ！）", "zh": "（这个时间的话，美奈子和奈绪应该都在剧场。她们听到这个消息，一定都会很高兴！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8e6c32ecee378d5299fb219190712470697eef61bff010a347d6934b0fdb48b4", "ja": "そうだ、美奈子。劇場の近くにできた\nドーナツ屋さんに行ってきたんだって？　どうだった？", "zh": "对了，美奈子。听说你去剧场附近新开的甜甜圈店了？感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "6d9e1638e1f8599ede30e72125ba6bafebd5bd7368ad4724c0f86806d2c5e6f8", "ja": "すっごくおいしかったよ！　さすが、恵美ちゃんの\nオススメだね！　あ、それでね、お店で見たんだけど。", "zh": "特别好吃哦！不愧是惠美推荐的！啊，对了，我还在店里看到了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "da89e5620a5bbd1986a6f533ed3e367d48c19719ac2e635c1aa13fc9bed83e77", "ja": "歩ちゃんが好きだって言ってた洋服のブランドと、今度\nコラボするんだって！　Tシャツとか出るみたいだよ♪", "zh": "听说要和步喜欢的那个服装品牌合作！据说还会推出T恤之类的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "26abf2668b683e78e19b091f525bb7fd7fd98f366b69bf84bf17f78cae378e30", "ja": "え～っ、マジで！？\nそれ、絶対手に入れなきゃいけないヤツじゃん！", "zh": "诶——真的假的！？\n那不是绝对得想办法弄到手才行的东西嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "acebdde712b91369cd8b549cc3a1492385498211051b1efea3331a09a426199b", "ja": "うわぁ、どんな感じなんだろ？\n普段使いできる、カッコイイヤツだったら最高だな～！", "zh": "哇～，不知道会是什么样的呢？\n要是那种平时也能用、又很帅气的东西就太棒了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "345886eb73fc4a99d0ccbdfc40836dd95575eede582255f3a707e87c2a55dccd", "ja": "あ、それで思い出したわ。昨日見たドラマの衣装、\nそことタイアップしとったわ。パーカーとキャップ！", "zh": "啊，这么一说我想起来了。昨天看的电视剧里的服装，和那边联动了。连帽衫和帽子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "716886f7cea7de9430f36ec8fc1dc5468b3c2c5861dae85c66a0984ade3aa14d", "ja": "ええっ、そうなの！？　マイガー！　多分それ、\n今期の新作だよね？　うわぁ、見逃した～！", "zh": "诶，原来是这样！？天哪！那应该是本季度的新款吧？呜哇，居然错过了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1008_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6509ff3414ec0f09c984150151c2122ba784d00e450b832bb0accddded848eef", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n今日はずいぶん賑やかだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n今天可真热闹啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "a62cc20b81962dde43103b0876a5a870065537047afe8755224b710742ebf279", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c71dfc0f1d5f08181a12e1e3b37483bc0eb9174a5d66eeebd5c96da1d55bb413", "ja": "へへ、ちょっとね。美奈子と奈緒とドーナツの話を……\nあれ？　服の話だっけ？　まあ、いろいろとね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，就聊了一点。和美奈子、奈绪聊了聊甜甜圈……\n咦？是聊服装来着？总之，聊了不少呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "96fbfe28e59bdc3e99bc1aaab6356acd12c08e18a3b39d9b364fdbda89eeeef8", "ja": "私らアイドルですし、流行り物には\n敏感でないとやんな！", "zh": "我们可是偶像嘛，对流行事物也得敏感点才行呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "29db56bda32bb9c3fc9ec961e481abf624ad1f7859aac148869f3193ba5eedab", "ja": "うん、確かにそうだな。けど、ちょうど良かった。\n美奈子と奈緒に仕事の話があるんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样。不过，来得正好。\n我有份工作想跟美奈子和奈绪商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "9461354c3db0690623e2f884ea9b92c7bbe5ae231280e5301d5e3e1e8577537c", "ja": "私と奈緒ちゃんに、ですか？", "zh": "是关于我和奈绪的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "047c194e6f9c3673d8cbeb2b1f1b974432bb21859b20787c1224a8876676357a", "ja": "流行り物に関係あるんです？", "zh": "这和流行的东西有关吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3fabd2aa1e0da895d9705112c74361e7ae8dfabe5a7e09176355f096e2805924", "ja": "ああ。ふたりに、モデルのオファーが来たんだ。\nこの雑誌なんだけど。", "zh": "啊。有人向她们俩发来了模特邀约。\n就是这本杂志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "899040bd77445e08870c20a91dbdf14af6556a9b1c7bc377dea1b767f51ff979", "ja": "えええええっ！\nこれ、『extra-mint-girl』じゃんっ！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶——！\n这不是《extra-mint-girl》吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "72b1b7b94bf97b0986e07bf34691b800bc44db8de0ef5f17a24d36cc8881aa00", "ja": "お、流石に歩は知ってるみたいだな。\n十代の女の子に人気の雑誌みたいだけど……。", "zh": "哦，看来步确实知道呢。\n好像是本很受十几岁女孩欢迎的杂志……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "786081350f853e0517bda3f3631efec496058dd7dcd07bc2158fe84c572cd908", "ja": "人気も何も、超人気だよ！　キレイ系っていうより、\nカジュアルでクールな、ストリート系御用達ってね！", "zh": "说什么受欢迎不受欢迎的，简直超受欢迎啊！与其说是漂亮系，不如说是休闲又酷的街头风潮人御用杂志！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "116781f571124f8b171af4671a7a489d084f561e778828a0bae7bacf17e95245", "ja": "あれ、ごようたしでいいんだっけ？　ごようたつ？\n……ま、どっちでもいっか！", "zh": "咦，是念作goyoutashi来着吗？还是goyoutatsu？\n……嘛，管它哪个都行啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "104bd597782d277945323186ad06a87dc195b9b7b4091830d667b12dc8e26cb1", "ja": "アタシも高校くらいまでは、よく読んでたよ！\nうわ～、懐かしいな～。", "zh": "我在高中之前也经常读呢！\n哇～真让人怀念啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9bf7acb889cc0b65b94dc2ff5c67898c2b5c808cf3c4f817132fe811c225b274", "ja": "まぁ、どっちも使うからいいけど……\n美奈子と奈緒はどうだ？", "zh": "嘛，反正两种都会用，所以没关系……\n美奈子和奈绪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "0e522e4e3db814a0d3e4b9c8338d88fd867f629a9ca75756bf6c6301d108d6f6", "ja": "もちろん知ってます！　っていうか、\nこれ読モ系でめっちゃ有名ですよね？", "zh": "我当然知道了！话说回来，\n这本在读者模特圈子里超有名的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "459fba6fb5f4e35694fdedbb920dad297c6fdfb5c12d1456cf6e5d04136e2a29", "ja": "私も、読んだことあります。学校でも、オシャレが\n特に好きな子が読んでるってイメージですね。", "zh": "我也读过。感觉学校里特别喜欢时尚的女生都会看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0a9d7e8392221a52e0e4c94376a06aa9b5a27f42261aaa8b0c8ec2c3a4de8765", "ja": "なるほど。やっぱり、ファッション誌の中でも\nなかなか尖った存在なんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。果然，在时尚杂志中也是相当前卫的存在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0b8bb113d53948dd3edae2e7b1e4e0d34f7efd0291e5fee44c0b36a41c37dd7d", "ja": "{$P$}、『e-m-girl』って\nたしかショーもやってたよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，《e-m-girl》好像也办过时装秀吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7817fc5df3ceba2d17c9af6eab2e6ce0491c2a1f6bc905dbc31f45b45dd5549f", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。美奈子と奈緒には、\nまず本誌の特集ページに出てもらって……。", "zh": "嗯，是这样的。先让美奈子和奈绪登上本刊的专题页面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3360a84b6f87af5f5cb90ab77037cda6c7d4cad7390ed0758b0954cb1ed30cdf", "ja": "その後に、出版社が主催するコレクションに\nモデルとして出演してもらう事になっているんだ。", "zh": "之后还要以模特的身份参加出版社主办的时装秀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "72b6755132421e7bcc7cdfa665241486b602ddad877139bba30c2b76214fa307", "ja": "え、えええ～！？　そのコレクションって、\n毎回カリスマモデルが誕生するとかいう……？", "zh": "诶、诶诶诶～！？那个时装秀是每次都会诞生魅力超凡的模特的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "9e8bd793bbdc62080e09e790db46cbdd448033aa4281adb0313f6d4723bedc55", "ja": "それに、私たちが出演！？　……わ、わっほーい！\nテンション上がってきましたっ！！", "zh": "而且，我们还要出演！？……哇、哇呼——！\n情绪高涨起来了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "f92efe0b7664886573f091881a0c6b7d4bf102fda172e7cfcbc5bf3985bd2c0e", "ja": "いや、喜ぶのはまだ早いんだ。毎月、どのページや\nモデルが人気だったか、読者投票があるんだが……。", "zh": "不，先别急着高兴。每个月都会根据读者投票，评选出最受欢迎的页面和模特……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b0cbb424f216be4107a1ee866fa51374341ac70e4d4d157bbb03b00204d4ade6", "ja": "そこで1位を取れば、なんと！　1年間、\n雑誌のモデルとして掲載し続けてくれるんだ！", "zh": "只要在那里拿到第1名，居然就能连续1年作为杂志模特登场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "5f51894173f5ebecbd5940f96bd603db9b2d7f9280ca70affe3fbe3482d2a00f", "ja": "ええーっ！？", "zh": "咦咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "5f51894173f5ebecbd5940f96bd603db9b2d7f9280ca70affe3fbe3482d2a00f", "ja": "ええーっ！？", "zh": "咦咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5f51894173f5ebecbd5940f96bd603db9b2d7f9280ca70affe3fbe3482d2a00f", "ja": "ええーっ！？", "zh": "咦咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "ab09c97ee5d13c292d5e600d0890f7be02397b66c02ed31955e841850f6385a2", "ja": "そこで、ふたりにはモデルデビューと同時に、\nユニットも組んでもらう事にした。", "zh": "所以，我决定让你们两位在模特出道的同时，也组成一个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "608bf10bfa4f9bbc1b11c8373653d830a89e0b0a7d36255ce74701c77b5749b0", "ja": "テーマは、トレンドを発信し続ける女子のカリスマ！\n十代のファッションリーダーとして、頑張ってくれ！", "zh": "主题是持续引领潮流的少女界偶像！作为十几岁的时尚领袖，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2a6e9ad96f138f9ad39f247cb7b6c88195abe5b033b0ce57bb57a6de459a5363", "ja": "すごいじゃん、ふたりとも！　チャンスだよ！\n絶対1位になって、モデルの仕事をゲットしなきゃな！", "zh": "太厉害了吧，你们两个！这是机会啊！\n一定要拿到第1名，争取接到模特的工作才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "e111334fde76b09fba03ddbbcd7fa18662480b6619e5234a653fe94a84ddcb85", "ja": "せやな！　私らがモデルで売って売って売りまくって、\n劇場のお客さんをどかーんと増やしてみせますよ！", "zh": "对啊！我们要靠模特工作大卖特卖，努力让剧场的客人数量轰的一下增加给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1040_019min", "source_sha256": "89dcecc370837b6e81e80bef19bb8cdce0caf94d6b654fe9ad166600906c0c47", "ja": "うんっ！　そうだね、奈緒ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯！就是这样，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "e2c9a9fa8b8d46be5cb8f0eadb1b9200367d5ec64b65aee08e33f297528b6c02", "ja": "あっ……でも、『e-m-girl』の人気投票やろ？\nめっちゃ厳しそうな感じがするんですけど……。", "zh": "啊……不过，是『e-m-girl』的人气投票吧？  \n感觉好像非常难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "2b065a7204c27d24de10863fad5195fff818602a67431e1f6b3820b4d7ebc5ac", "ja": "俺もそう聞いてるよ。新人がランキングの\n上位に入るのは、かなり難易度が高いらしい。", "zh": "我听说也是这样。新人要挤进排行榜前列，似乎相当困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "996d982f07aa875ee8fd8c1d18fcff95c859562861af31da28307447caebb717", "ja": "何しろ、相手は既に人気のモデルだし……\nファンがついている人も多いからな。", "zh": "毕竟，对手可是已经颇有人气的模特……有不少人都已经拥有自己的粉丝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1044_019min", "source_sha256": "c8d114ff8d8d75708fce4ce3241b8de778af0af421b93337f86e8b78238ae36f", "ja": "うぅ……やっぱり、そうですよね……。", "zh": "呜呜……果然，还是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "bd4365283ddb225321a4742488d3f3ad539cbf987db25e16889c07b4bf632be4", "ja": "だから、いつもより気合いを入れて臨んでほしい。\nふたりはユニットの仲間だが同時にライバルでもある。", "zh": "所以，我希望你们能比平时更加认真地投入其中。\n你们两人既是组合的伙伴，同时也是竞争对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1046_019min", "source_sha256": "19fbedf6023a886bad6908ceb5569b0ad1d598511077ad683900d25f481f07dd", "ja": "ユニットだけど、ライバル……。", "zh": "虽然是同一个组合，却也是对手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "7b61f3ec9cc1a40bf3a4ff543c8d3921586d84e0f250eb675be60aafab8d95c8", "ja": "同じ劇場の仲間で、ライバルか……なんや、\nちょっと新鮮やんな。お互いがんばろうな、美奈子！", "zh": "既然同为一个剧场的伙伴，也是竞争对手啊……\n感觉还挺新鲜的呢。我们都要加油哦，美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "24fe96f05413b5a312a80b2a849893ea19f301d16a7d72b62a809d9e60f56be1", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん……う、うん！\nそうだよね、がんばらなくちゃ……。", "zh": "奈绪……嗯、嗯！\n说得对，必须好好加油才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "6ca9b58fe9da1a2147a387e284372b5804405a9b1fa363d2078722fcdcc1faca", "ja": "？　美奈子？", "zh": "？美奈子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1050_037nao", "source_sha256": "23e46b47ea2da0ab57a49a8e30fb40e273ee1c58221c243fb7ceabdee62c1ae7", "ja": "ふっふーん、美奈子には負けへんで～？\n関西の星のファッションセンス、見せつけたるわ！", "zh": "哼哼，我可不会输给美奈子哦～？\n就让你见识一下关西之星的时尚品味吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1051_019min", "source_sha256": "bb26b294b17778ac5052647aa47ec94267a065807c34fef90123caade31025bc", "ja": "わ、私だって、奈緒ちゃんには負けないよ！　特別、\nファッションに、自信があるわけじゃないけど……。", "zh": "我、我也不会输给奈绪的！虽然我并不是特别有时尚方面的自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1052_p", "source_sha256": "be08f2b2883b9b51cb07cf7a93482f63c7b7fd8152c8a94e7be5285850f827b1", "ja": "ああ、それでなんだけど。歩はファッションに\n詳しいし、ふたりの事をサポートしてくれないか？", "zh": "啊，对了，我是想说……步很懂时尚，能不能帮忙支持一下她们两个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1053_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2073bf31e4a513998b60fd91e94f1ed003db62a0b63340328d12feae9394609d", "ja": "オッケー、まかせてよ♪\nみんなでナンバーワンの座をつかみ取ろうぜ！", "zh": "好，交给我吧♪\n大家一起夺得第一名吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "7070d76967206b883cc88f32618815247b35b697cc06ececa6d4f61b17b93334", "ja": "ナンバーワンになれるのは1人だけだけど……\nまあ、細かいことはいいか。よし、みんなで頑張ろう！", "zh": "能成为第一名的只有1人，不过……\n嘛，细节就别在意了。好，大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1055_019min", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1056_037nao", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0123_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "2b2b9334d13b055e5021ab9ad141ffc28322e4676cc07b1c1aeacbf45f70cf7a", "ja": "（美奈子も奈緒も、やる気は十分みたいだ。\nさあ、これから忙しくなるぞ……！）", "zh": "（美奈子和奈绪似乎都干劲十足。\n好了，接下来可要忙起来了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
